<title>USA: Anderson Cty SD 1, S.C., won by Sterne Agee &amp; Leach. [CORRECTED 17:35 GMT]</title>
<headline>Anderson Cty SD 1, S.C., won by Sterne Agee &amp; Leach. [CORRECTED 17:35 GMT]</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-08-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sterne Agee &amp; Leach Inc (corrects from Wachovia Bank of North Carolina) said it won $1.340 million of Anderson County School District No. 1, S.C., general obligation bonds, Series 1996, with a net interest cost of 4.9916 percent (corrects from 5.10 percent).</p>
</text>
